        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "Jinshan Xiong",
          "email": "jinshanx@google.com",
          "date": "2026-10-28 23:48:13.000000000",
          "tz": 0
        },
        "subject": "LU-21058 lnet: send connect RPCs without waiting for credits",
        "message": "LU-21058 lnet: send connect RPCs without waiting for credits\n\nWhen a server hangs or reboots, RPCs in flight to it can hold all\nof the client's peer tx credits until the LND times them out.  The\nreconnect queues behind them on lpni_txq, the import stays in\nCONNECTING, and the client misses the recovery window and is\nevicted (see also LU-18681).\n\nAdd LNET_MD_URGENT: messages from such an MD neither take nor wait\nfor LNet peer or NI tx credits.  Set it for connect requests and\nreplies in ptl_send_buf().  Add sanity-lnet test_259.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nTest-Parameters: testlist=recovery-small\nTest-Parameters: testlist=replay-single\nSigned-off-by: Jinshan Xiong <jinshanx@google.com>\nAssisted-by: Jetski\nChange-Id: Ib0f51d271036e47b0d60bbcca1e262916424e8d3\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
